# RentMe 2.0 — application rules

## Stack (this repo)

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| UI | Angular 21, standalone components, SCSS, `provideRouter` |
| Auth / DB / files | Firebase (SDK `firebase`, **not** `@angular/fire` on Angular 21) |
| Wiring | `provideRentMeFirebase()` in `src/app/app.config.ts` |
| Inject tokens | `FIREBASE_AUTH`, `FIREBASE_FIRESTORE`, `FIREBASE_STORAGE` from `src/app/core/firebase/` |

**Do not** add Supabase, Astro, Next, or re-scaffold with `10x-astro-starter` unless `context/foundation/tech-stack.md` is deliberately changed.

Hand-off on disk: `starter_id: angular` + Firebase described in `## Why this stack`.

## Product source of truth

- `context/foundation/prd.md` — FR-001…FR-008, non-goals
- `context/foundation/tech-stack.md` — stack metadata
- Domain rule: date-aware rental matching; confirmed bookings block calendar

## Code layout

```
src/app/
  core/       # firebase, api, auth guards, models
  features/   # auth | seeker | provider | bookings
  shared/     # dumb UI only
```

- Domain reads/writes via **`ApiService`** (`core/api/`), not Firestore in components
- Auth: Firebase SDK in `AuthService`; login is **not** `POST /api/auth/login`
- API errors: `err?.error?.error` ← `{ error: string }`
- Routes in `app.routes.ts`; `/seeker` and `/provider` use `roleGuard`

## Project skills

| Invoke | When |
|--------|------|
| `rentme-stack` | Structure, MVP scope |
| `rentme-firebase` | Auth, Firestore model, rules, emulators |
| `rentme-feature` | Implement a specific FR / US |

## Config & secrets

- `src/environments/environment.example.ts` → copy to `environment.ts` (gitignored)
- Never commit real Firebase keys

## MVP out of scope

Payments, in-app chat, OAuth, delivery logistics, favorites (FR-009).

## Course chain (context only)

For `/10x-init` … `/10x-agents-md` use files under `context/` — see `10x-course.mdc` and `.cursor/skills/README.md`. Do not paste full PRD into every rule file; reference `@context/foundation/prd.md`.
